        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Briars grow and twist from the ground surrounding the Bramble Orb. This effect does not harm Asira, Terina, or Rashai. Creatures in a 45 foot emanation (or smaller, if any successes have been achieved towards disabling this hazard) within 15 feet of the ground take @Damage[(3d10+6)[piercing]|options:primal,divine,plant] (@Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:primal,divine,plant]).</p><p>Creatures that fail the reflex save become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure).</p><p>Track the radius of this ability using the @UUID[Compendium.covalon.briarmurk-items.Item.RhbCvt6mp4f7seCQ]{Tangled Briar Thicket} effect, apply it to the hazard and left click the effect once to reduce the area by 15 feet.</p>"
        },
